      "side": 1,
      "message": "Well we have 3 \"pvmfw\":\n\n- the pvmfw.bin, which is built by stripping the pvmfw ELF\n- the pvmfw.img partition, which is the pvmfw.bin, wrapped in a boot.img format and AVB signed, which ABL loads, verifies and extracts to RAM\n- the \"pvmfw blob\" (doesn\u0027t really have a file name because it was never a file until today) that consists of pvmfw.bin+config data and which is passed to the HV\n\nso I\u0027d rather not call the last one \"pvmfw.img\" as it might be confused with the first one.\n\nTBF, in this comment, I would just say that we\u0027re testing pvmfw (no suffix).",
